    "Count the screws. Nine is the gold guard window, thirteen is everything after it.",
  ],
  [
    "1960",
    "The Kluson tuners move from a blank housing back to a single line of text around now. Worth knowing that many necks from the middle of 1959 into 1960 carry no date at all.",
    "A completely blank neck heel in this window is normal rather than suspicious.",
  ],
  [
    "1961",
    "The amber switch tip gives way to a whiter plastic, which stays for the rest of the run. Around here the tremolo plate also stops being marked Pat. Pend. and starts carrying a full patent number.",
